# Component Conventions

- One component per folder when >1 file: `Feature/Feature.tsx`, `index.ts`.
- File names: component `PascalCase.tsx`, tests `.test.tsx`.
- Style with **Tailwind CSS**; use contextual color variables (e.g., `bg-background` not `bg-lightGreen`).
- Only use `style={{ ... }}` when absolutely necessary (dynamic values, complex calculations).
- Avoid Material-UI patterns: no `sx` props, prefer Tailwind classes over inline styles.
- Props: minimal, optional `?`, positive booleans, sensible defaults.
- Accessibility: text/aria-label, keyboard focus, contrast ≥ 4.5:1.
- Storybook stories required once Storybook added.
- Avoid business logic in components; delegate to hooks.
